WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.250
A season with BaseballLineup.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.210
Coaching a youth baseball team is a lot of paperwork.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.300
Before the season, create your team in two minutes.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.920
During the week, parents answer attendance with a single tap.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.420
Your practices are planned in two minutes, drills included.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:26.960
Before the game, one click: the lineup is fair, and the Baseball Québec rules are followed.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.600
A specific idea? Ask the AI.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.550
And you know your opponent: their record, their pitchers, your chances.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.020
On game day, the sheet comes out ready for the umpire.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.680
The tracker records every plate appearance.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.600
After the game, pitcher rest is calculated…

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:52.590
… and your players are evaluated in a few seconds.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:59.100
At the end of the season, every player has their report, and you know who is eligible for the playoffs.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:03.150
To be ready, fair, and informed.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:10.810
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball. Create your team now.
